Package: pinger
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: dhtech <dhtech@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= @PYTHON@~), python3 (<< @PYTHON_NEXT@), python3-prometheus-client, libc6 (>= @GLIBC@)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/dhtech/pinger
Description: ICMP pinger for Prometheus (pingerd)
 pingerd pings every host of the IP plan (/etc/ipplan.db) that has an
 IPv4 address, once a second, and serves how long the answers took as
 the histogram icmp_rtt_seconds on port 13110.
 .
 The unit pingerd.service is installed; a first installation neither
 enables nor starts it.
